# the source table, the cited sources and the registered generators
#
# every source a generator reads is a named value listed once in the source
# table, with its upstream, its exact revision, its licence and its checksum,
# and its attribution in masc's NOTICE. a release an overlay cites that gen
# may not hold is listed once among the cited sources, with its package's
# upstream, revision, terms and checksum. a generator names its source and its
# further sources by value, never by position. every set's generator is one
# row of the generators. adding a set's generator is a source, a row in each
# table and its module.

